  "description": "<p>Range <strong>30ft</strong>; <strong>30ft</strong>-radius area, <strong>1 hour per level</strong>; needs holy water.</p><ul><li>Undead inside have <strong>Disadvantage</strong> on their first attack roll each round and take -1 to damage and saves.</li><li>Cast reversed (Desecrate), undead inside instead have <strong>Advantage</strong> on their first attack roll each round and gain +1 to damage and saves, and Turn Undead against them takes -1.</li><li>Material: silver dust worth 25 gp, consumed.</li></ul><p class=\"arn-note\"><strong>Reversible:</strong> may be cast as its opposite with the same slot.</p><p class=\"arn-note\"><strong>Costly component:</strong> see Rare Spell Components in the Shopkeeper's Catalogue.</p><p class=\"arn-note\"><strong>Classes:</strong> Cleric, Paladin</p>",
